      "id": 5,
      "number": 5,
      "original_number": 141,
      "text": "A GPT-based model is fine-tuned for story generation. During evaluation, you test different decoding strategies on the same prompt: 1. Method A: Every run produces the exact same story, even when executed multiple times. 2. Method B: The story changes slightly in each run, but overall structure and key events remain similar. 3. Method C: The story is wildly different each time, sometimes even changing the genre. Based on the observations, select the most likely decoding strategies for each method:",
      "type": "multichoice",
      "options": [
        "Method A: Greedy decoding",
